# One line ending everywhere. Without this, core.autocrlf on a Windows checkout writes CRLF into
# the working tree, and oxfmt (endOfLine: lf) rewrites every line of every file it touches.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched: binary content, and the lockfile npm regenerates itself.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
package-lock.json -diff linguist-generated
